    },
    {
      "title": "Reduce Embe dding LR",
      "spec": "Change EMBEDDING_LR from 0.6 to 0.3. The token embeddings are stable functions; a lower learning rate can prevent them from overfitting or developing byzantine representations.",
      "family": "schedule"
    },
    {
      "title": "Zero Weight Decay",
